From 0afa4cd3fef10474cf4362858b5ce6766e982856 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: noctis <970308389@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 14:36:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] crosvm: disable unsupported seccomp rules on LoongArch64

The generated seccomp policies only cover x86_64 and aarch64. Explicitly disable their architecture-specific genrules for LoongArch64, matching the existing RISC-V behavior.

Change-Id: Icda505a9d116b7a90044302016ee81269fde8fc8
---
 jail/seccomp/Android.bp | 93 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 93 insertions(+)

